{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ea8e608c-0835-83dd-a894-8c80f2089cb0",
  "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:26:58-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luz Mejia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:24:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:24:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, good morning. So I'm sorry, I'm calling from my car, I just dropped my mom's groceries off and I'm still sort of in my coffee, you know? Anyway, I'm calling for my mother."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:25:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:25:03-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the plow came through early, which is great, but it pushed this whole wall of snow right on top of the bus stop. Like you can't get to the bench, you can't even see the sign. My mom takes that bus, and she's not climbing over a snowbank."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:25:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that happens, the blade just shoves it all to the curb. Where's the stop exactly? I'll jot that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:25:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right out front of 333 Memorial Boulevard. Easton's Beach side, so, across from the water, basically."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:25:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 333 Memorial Boulevard, bus stop buried by plowed snow. Is it the whole sidewalk edge or just the stop area?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:25:46-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly right at the stop. It's like four feet high, kind of packed and heavy. Oh, and the neighbor's side is clear, because that guy has a little shovel thing going. He's the one who's always borrowing sugar from my mom, it got to be a running joke in the family, like, nobody bakes that much. Sorry, anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:26:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Ha, okay. So what you're asking is for a plow to come back and open up the stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:26:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. If somebody can come back through and clear it out, that'd be great."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:26:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll put in a request for a return pass at that location. Do you want a call back when it's on the list?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:26:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0183."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:26:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero-one-eight-three, perfect. I've got you down as Luz?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:26:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, Luz Mejia. M-E-J-I-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:26:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Luz. I'll send it over to the crew supervisor this morning. Crews are doing cleanup passes today, so it should get looked at today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:26:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that works. Thank you so much, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:26:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet. Have a good one."
    }
  ],
